WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:18.238
Skyler: I want my parrot back!

2
00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:23.037
Riley: Don't worry. We'll find a way to get Chatter back.

3
00:00:23.038 --> 00:00:24.860
Ben: There's the zookeeper.

4
00:00:24.861 --> 00:00:28.648
Maybe he can help us.

5
00:00:28.649 --> 00:00:31.855
Skyler: Sir, please help us!

6
00:00:31.856 --> 00:00:35.402
My parrot flew into the cage!

7
00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:39.022
Theo: And now we can't tell which one is hers.

8
00:00:39.023 --> 00:00:42.278
Ben: And which one is the zoo's!

9
00:00:42.279 --> 00:00:50.713
Zookeeper: Wait. You mean one of those parrots is yours?

10
00:00:50.714 --> 00:00:54.302
Skyler: Yes, and I want my parrot right now!

11
00:00:54.303 --> 00:00:56.343
Zookeeper: Try calling him.

12
00:00:56.344 --> 00:00:59.727
Maybe he'll fly over to you.

13
00:00:59.728 --> 00:01:02.637
Skyler: Here, Chatter!

14
00:01:02.638 --> 00:01:07.014
Chatter: Here, Chatter. Ha-ha. Ha-ha.

15
00:01:07.015 --> 00:01:10.095
Skyler: See, that's Chatter!

16
00:01:10.096 --> 00:01:17.207
Zoo parrot: Here, Chatter. Ha-ha. Ha-ha.

17
00:01:17.208 --> 00:01:19.352
Skyler: Maybe it's not Chatter!

18
00:01:19.353 --> 00:01:23.249
I'm so confused!

19
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.201
Skyler: What am I going to do?

20
00:01:25.202 --> 00:01:28.187
I can't go home without Chatter.

21
00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:31.155
Chatter: Go home! Do your homework!

22
00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:36.219
Skyler: Chatter! It is you!

23
00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:39.446
Zookeeper: Are you sure that's your bird?

24
00:01:39.447 --> 00:01:44.043
Skyler: Yes. Only Chatter would tell me to do my homework!

25
00:01:44.044 --> 00:01:55.042
Zookeeper: Okay. I'll unlock the cage and get your bird.

26
00:01:55.043 --> 00:01:58.699
Skyler: Oh, Chatter, I'm so glad to have you back!

27
00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.304
Chatter: Wipe your feet!

28
00:02:00.305 --> 00:02:02.297
Time to eat!

29
00:02:02.298 --> 00:02:04.357
Mrs. Summers: It is time to eat.

30
00:02:04.358 --> 00:02:07.007
Riley: I'm really hungry!

31
00:02:07.008 --> 00:02:08.975
Sarah: I am too.

32
00:02:08.976 --> 00:02:21.734
Mrs. Summers: Let's go have lunch!

33
00:02:21.735 --> 00:02:23.443
Ben: That was fun.

34
00:02:23.444 --> 00:02:26.753
I'm glad the Pet Lovers Club went to the zoo.

35
00:02:26.754 --> 00:02:31.043
Chatter: Squawk. Me too!

36
00:02:31.044 --> 00:02:33.255
Riley: That was very fun.

37
00:02:33.256 --> 00:02:41.492
But I can't wait to see Snooks!
